# MDS 2026 — Python codebase reference

Documentation for the 20 Python modules at the root of
`D folder/MDS Work/2026`. Generated 14 August 2026 from the source as it stood
on that date.

These modules support the Melbourne Dental School assessment workflow: they pull
student assessment forms out of the **DASH** platform (API + Postgres), reshape
them, and generate cohort and per-student feedback reports as PDF and Excel,
plus at-risk flagging, assessor-bias analysis and two live Gradio dashboards.

