## 7. Conventions in this codebase

- **Naming.** Report builders are `build*`; SQL builders are `get*Sql`; data
  fetchers are `get*Df` / `readDf`; private helpers are `_`-prefixed. openpyxl
  sheet writers in `boh3_dds4_utils` are `_sheet*` / `_xl*`.
- **The single DB read path is `Utils.readDf(sql, engine)`.** Everything that
  touches Postgres for reading goes through it.
- **PDF = ReportLab, Excel = openpyxl, charts = matplotlib** rendered to an image
  and embedded via `Utils.addPlotImage`. There is no other rendering stack.
- **Cohort codes**: `BOH1`–`BOH3` (Bachelor of Oral Health years 1–3),
  `DDS1`–`DDS4` (Doctor of Dental Surgery years 1–4). BOH3 and DDS4 are the final
  years and share `boh3_dds4_utils`.
- **`rawforms`** = raw Postgres JSON; **`rawform_forms`** = one row per form;
  **`rawform_form_items`** = exploded to item level; **`_v3`** = the current
  schema. (From the project `readme.md`.)
- **Backups.** The convention in this folder is `x.py.bak_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS`;
  several exist for the large modules.

